urrent YouTube, FTC, and USCO pages before you monetize. Do not clone people without consent."},"452":{"id":"/dub-25","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#local-dub","content":"`restart: \"no\"`, type **yes** on start, headroom, and download-limit are unchanged. Occupancy is **audio** — stop Klein / Wan / LTX first."},"453":{"id":"/dub-26","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#this-is-not-the-podcast-lane","content":"Local podcast invents hosts and uses Kokoro stock voices. This lane clones **recorded speakers** from a show you own or are licensed to translate. Different disclosure. Different App."},"454":{"id":"/dub-27","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#this-is-not-the-podcast-lane","content":"Spoken disclosure defaults **off**. Sidecars are always written (localized `ez_dub.disclosure.txt` plus English `ez_dub.disclosure.en.txt`). If you turn the bumper on, it is a short localized overlay on `ez_dub_mix.wav` only — never on the duration-locked YT wav. When the bumper is off, `ez_dub_mix` (and the Comfy FLAC) drops leading hush so the clip starts on speech; `ez_dub_yt.wav` stays source-timed."},"455":{"id":"/dub-28","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#this-is-not-the-podcast-lane","content":"English canonical:"},"456":{"id":"/dub-29","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#this-is-not-the-podcast-lane","content":"> This audio is an AI-translated dub. Voices are synthesized from the original speakers with the rights-holder's authorization."},"457":{"id":"/dub-30","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#rights","content":"Queue **refuses** unless App **I have rights** is on. That widget defaults **off**."},"458":{"id":"/dub-31","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#rights","content":"Use this App when:"},"459":{"id":"/dub-32","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#rights","content":"You own the recording, or"},"460":{"id":"/dub-33","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#rights","content":"Every speaker consented, and you have a license to translate and redistribute"},"461":{"id":"/dub-34","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#rights","content":"Do not paste celebrity reference WAVs. Refs are extracted from **this** job’s audio. URL ingest is for operator-owned or licensed URLs only. YouTube’s terms of service still apply to `yt-dlp`."},"462":{"id":"/dub-35","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#quality-bar","content":"Production-usable for podcasts with 2–6 speakers and mostly turn-taking, **and for a \\~64 s single-speaker monologue**. Clone quality levers: clean 6–10 s per-speaker refs (one take when possible), **Clone CFG** auto **0.3** on EN→ES (CFG 0 disables T3 text-following and vocodes a moan; 0.3 still reduces reference accent vs 0.5; one retry at 0.5 if that take is not speech-like), onset-crop of Chatterbox hush / PerTh floor before fit, duration lock that pitch-preserves &#x2A;*up to 1.25×** then spills into the following gap then fade-trims (it does not crush a 40 s clone into a 2 s window), same-speaker merge when the gap is under 0.35 s capped at 12 s so `fit_turn` stays speakable, in-graph raise-to-peak (optional ffmpeg −14 LUFS), and `qc.json`. After render, A/B `dubs/<slug>/render/turn_NNNN.raw.wav` (onset-cropped TTS) vs `turn_NNNN.wav` (fitted). Unvoiced / steady-tone / PerTh-drone / F0-glide “whale” clones are a **blocking miss** on a cross-language job: empty mix + Dub status `clone unvoiced — empty mix`, never a duration-locked YT wav of a tone, hush, or ducked English. `qc.json` `mix_not_speech` is a fail even when peak ≥ 0.25. **Job slug** is always a string (`episode` when a bool leaks in); **Upload media** is a button only and does not occupy a serialized widget slot. Editable translation JSON is the other lever (Stage **analyze**, edit, Rewrite **off**, Stage **render**). Default Stage **all** runs analyze then clone in one Queue. Do not disable PerTh."},"463":{"id":"/dub-36","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#quality-bar","content":"Hard cases: heavy overlap, stadium noise, singing, very fast banter, on-camera lip sync. **No lip-sync OSS** (Wav2Lip stays banned). Mouths will not match on talking-head video."},"464":{"id":"/dub-37","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Stage"},"465":{"id":"/dub-38","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Default"},"466":{"id":"/dub-39","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"License"},"467":{"id":"/dub-40","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Download"},"468":{"id":"/dub-41","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"ASR / turns"},"469":{"id":"/dub-42","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"faster-whisper large-v3 segments (`vad_filter` when the wheel supports it)"},"470":{"id":"/dub-43","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"MIT"},"471":{"id":"/dub-44","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"`download-dub --tier asr`"},"472":{"id":"/dub-45","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Speakers"},"473":{"id":"/dub-46","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Chatterbox `VoiceEncoder` + `ve.pt` (same embedding the clone uses). Energy fingerprint if the wheel is missing"},"474":{"id":"/dub-47","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"MIT"},"475":{"id":"/dub-48","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"`download-dub --tier clone`"},"476":{"id":"/dub-49","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"VAD helper"},"477":{"id":"/dub-50","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"faster-whisper Silero filter; ONNX on disk is the download leftover"},"478":{"id":"/dub-51","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"MIT"},"479":{"id":"/dub-52","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"`download-dub --tier asr`"},"480":{"id":"/dub-53","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Translate"},"481":{"id":"/dub-54","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"On-box Qwen3-4B-Instruct GGUF, **one turn at a time** (ISO source → target, temp 0.3, 120 s timeout). Needs `llama-cpp-python` CPU wheel"},"482":{"id":"/dub-55","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Apache 2.0"},"483":{"id":"/dub-56","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"GGUF already in `download-models`; wheel via CPU extra-index as `--index-url`, `download-dub`, or Queue self-heal"},"484":{"id":"/dub-57","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Clone"},"485":{"id":"/dub-58","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Chatterbox Multilingual V3 (cached `from_local` + ISO `language_id`, PerTh on). Cross-lang `cfg_weight` auto is **0.3** (retry 0.5). Lines over 300 characters split. T3 is capped per line (floor 200 tokens so hush cannot eat the budget); output is onset-cropped (hush / PerTh floor) before fit. Duration lock: ffmpeg `atempo` ≤1.25×, then spill, then fade-trim. First Queue is offline when the clone pack is complete (`Cangjie5_TC.json` + `MODELS_DIR/pkuseg`). \\~40 s/turn on GB10 is sequential sampling, not a leftover download"},"486":{"id":"/dub-59","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"MIT"},"487":{"id":"/dub-60","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"`download-dub --tier clone`"},"488":{"id":"/dub-61","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Clone alt"},"489":{"id":"/dub-62","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Qwen3-TTS 0.6B Base (`generate_voice_clone` + the same per-speaker refs). Wheel and weights are **separate**. Missing extra fail-fasts (one Dub status, empty mix). **No** silent fallback to chatterbox-ml"},"490":{"id":"/dub-63","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Apache 2.0"},"491":{"id":"/dub-64","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Wheel: `pip install --no-deps qwen-tts` (extras first; never unconstrained). Weights: `download-podcast --tier qwen3tts` (complete Base + nested 12Hz tokenizer)"},"492":{"id":"/dub-65","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Qwen3-TTS is **honest opt-in**. Entrypoint does **not** pip-install `qwen-tts` on start (official wheel pins `transformers==4.57.3` and would fight Comfy 0.34.6 + torch 2.14+cu130). `download-podcast --tier qwen3tts` with compose **up** installs extras (`einops`, `soundfile`) then `qwen-tts --no-deps`. Queue with **Clone engine** `qwen3tts` and no extra returns immediately: one Dub status, empty mix, never the original recording, never chatterbox-ml. A weights-only snapshot (`model.safetensors` alone) is **incomplete** — Base needs `config.json` + text tokenizer files + nested `speech_tokenizer/`."},"493":{"id":"/dub-66","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"`faster-whisper`, `chatterbox-tts`, and `llama-cpp-python` are fail-soft-baked in `phase-nodes.sh`. ASR and clone install **separately**: ASR first, then `setuptools<82` (PerTh / `pkg_resources`) and the Chatterbox GitHub zip (`CHATTERBOX_TTS_REF`, `--no-deps --force-reinstall`) so Chatterbox cannot pin `torch==2.6.0` over the lab 2.14 cu130 venv. Clone `FutureWarning`s for `LoRACompatibleLinear` and `torch.backends.cuda.sdp_kernel()` are lab-shimmed in bind-mounted `pythonpath/sitecustomize.py` (`nn.Linear` + `torch.nn.attention.sdpa_kernel`). Do **not** `pip install peft` to clear them — PEFT flips diffusers' LoRA backend for image graphs. PerTh stays on. PyPI `chatterbox-tts==0.1.7` has no `t3_model=v3`. setuptools 82+ leaves `perth.PerthImplicitWatermarker` as `None` — clone status names that miss (do not disable PerTh). llama-cpp-python uses the &#x2A;*official CPU extra-index as `--index-url`** (`--only-binary=:all:`, pin `0.3.35`, no CUDA extra-index) because PyPI is sdist-only and `--extra-index-url` alone can miss the aarch64 wheel. Direct GitHub manylinux wheel is the fallback (`--force-reinstall --no-deps`) when pip is already satisfied but `from llama_cpp import Llama` still fails. `download-dub` pip-installs ASR, the CPU wheel, the setuptools pin, and clone into a **running** container (volume venv Comfy execs). Restart heals PerTh when the watermarker is not callable. Queue also self-heals `llama-cpp-python` on first miss — no extra restart for the wheel. `yt-dlp` stays optional for URL ingest. The graph still loads if a wheel is missing; Queue writes an **empty mix** plus **Dub status** (never the original recording, never English cloned as the target). Missing llama.cpp / GGUF is **blocking** when Rewrite translation is on and source ≠ target — Queue does not run ASR or clone. On DGX Spark, CTranslate2 PyPI wheels are **CPU-only**; Whisper loads CPU int8 first."},"494":{"id":"/dub-67","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Chatterbox languages: Arabic, Danish, German, Greek, English, Spanish, Finnish, French, Hebrew, Hindi, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Malay, Dutch, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese, Russian, Swedish, Swahili, Turkish, Chinese. Soccer EN→ES is first-class."},"495":{"id":"/dub-68","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#engines","content":"Banned: F5-TTS, XTTS, Fish, Higgs, NLLB, SeamlessM4T, ElevenLabs, Wav2Lip, TTS-Audio-Suite."},"496":{"id":"/dub-69","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#download","content":"Dub weights are **opt-in**. `./scripts/manage.sh download-models` does **not** pull them. `doctor` prints dub JSON and still exits 0 when the pack is absent."},"497":{"id":"/dub-70","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#download","content":"URL ingest on the host (optional):"},"498":{"id":"/dub-71","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#app","content":"Graph: **audio/dub/clone-translate** (`extra.lab_profile` `us-safe-dub`). Occupancy **audio**."},"499":{"id":"/dub-72","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#app","content":"Widget"},"500":{"id":"/dub-73","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","youtube","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/dub#app","content":"Role"},"501":{"id":"/dub-74","page_id":"/dub","tags":["dub","translation","voice-clone","chatterbox","you