r user to the `docker` group; configure `nvidia-ctk` when present"},"588":{"id":"/getting-started-69","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#2-setup---install-docker","content":"Re-run `doctor`"},"589":{"id":"/getting-started-70","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#2-setup---install-docker","content":"**Verify:** next step is `doctor`. If `docker` permission is denied after install: `newgrp docker` (or re-login SSH), then continue."},"590":{"id":"/getting-started-71","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#2-setup---install-docker","content":"**Fail:** Host and Docker."},"591":{"id":"/getting-started-72","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#2-setup---install-docker","content":"??? tip \"Docker group not active in this shell\""},"592":{"id":"/getting-started-73","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#3-doctor","content":"Expect a passing run to print (among other lines) &#x2A;*`Doctor OK`**. Real doctor lines to look for:"},"593":{"id":"/getting-started-74","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#3-doctor","content":"`attention:` is `kitchen`, `sage`, `pytorch-fallback`, or `unknown` (unknown is normal while Compose is down). On a running Spark, `attention: pytorch-fallback` is a 10–20× slow path — Start and runtime."},"594":{"id":"/getting-started-75","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#3-doctor","content":"**Verify:** stderr ends with `Doctor OK`. Doctor also prints pack JSON (`image status`, `wan status`, `ltx status`, `llm status`) and the image tag for this git branch. **Missing lab weights are a warning**, not a hard fail (`lab workflow models incomplete (not a hard doctor failure)`)."},"595":{"id":"/getting-started-76","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#3-doctor","content":"**Fail (hard):** docker missing, compose missing, host headroom, or dirs not writable → Host and Docker. Prefer `setup` first."},"596":{"id":"/getting-started-77","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#3-doctor","content":"**docker missing**"},"597":{"id":"/getting-started-78","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#3-doctor","content":"**docker compose missing**"},"598":{"id":"/getting-started-79","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#3-doctor","content":"**host headroom** (RAM/disk)"},"599":{"id":"/getting-started-80","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#3-doctor","content":"**MODELS\\_DIR or COMFY\\_OUTPUT\\_DIR not writable**"},"600":{"id":"/getting-started-81","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#4-accept-ltx-25--set-hf_token","content":"LTX-2.5 is **gated**. Klein 4B and Wan 5B are Apache. A token in `.env` is **not** the same as accepting the Lightricks license. Policy: Model licenses."},"601":{"id":"/getting-started-82","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#4-accept-ltx-25--set-hf_token","content":"Open Lightricks/LTX-2.5 as **that** Hugging Face user and click **Agree**"},"602":{"id":"/getting-started-83","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#4-accept-ltx-25--set-hf_token","content":"Put `HF_TOKEN=hf_...` in `.env`, or `hf auth login`"},"603":{"id":"/getting-started-84","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#4-accept-ltx-25--set-hf_token","content":"Fine-grained tokens need gated-repo read"},"604":{"id":"/getting-started-85","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#4-accept-ltx-25--set-hf_token","content":"**Verify:** the Hugging Face model card shows the license accepted for this account; `.env` has `HF_TOKEN` (no quotes needed). Do not prefix later downloads with `sudo` — download-limit and `comfy/` ownership heal use sudo internally."},"605":{"id":"/getting-started-86","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#4-accept-ltx-25--set-hf_token","content":"**Fail:** Downloads."},"606":{"id":"/getting-started-87","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#5-download-models","content":"Default pack only: Klein 4B + Wan 2.2 5B + LTX-2.5 + prompt-enhance GGUF. &#x2A;*No `--tier`.** Throttled by download-limit (`auto` = &#x2A;*85%** of measured Mbps, cached 24h, when HTB works). The wrap **always clears on exit**."},"607":{"id":"/getting-started-88","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#5-download-models","content":"What"},"608":{"id":"/getting-started-89","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#5-download-models","content":"Detail"},"609":{"id":"/getting-started-90","page_id":"/getting-started","tags":["getting-started","docker","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/getting-started#5-download-models","content":"**Tiers**"},"610":{"id":"/getting-started-91","page_id":"/getting-started