 `# @function` comments. `generate_workflow_docs.py` writes `docs/generated/workflows/` and `docs/reference/workflow-nodes.md` from `_lab` JSON plus `docs/workflow_nodes.py`. `generate_cinema_docs.py` writes `docs/generated/cinema/` from Cinema Rack JSON. `generate_audio_docs.py` writes `docs/generated/audio/` from Audio Rack JSON. Do not hand-edit those files. The Next export fails closed on MDX/TypeScript errors."},"2161":{"id":"/contribute/testing-docs-49","page_id":"/contribute/testing-docs","tags":["testing","coverage","fumadocs","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/testing-docs#make-docs","content":"Pins: Fumadocs on Next.js 16 (`docs-site/package.json`). Node &#x2A;*22+**. Docs style."},"2162":{"id":"/contribute/testing-docs-50","page_id":"/contribute/testing-docs","tags":["testing","coverage","fumadocs","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/testing-docs#deploy-docsyml","content":"`.github/workflows/deploy-docs.yml&#x60; runs on push to &#x2A;*`main`*&#x2A; / &#x2A;*`development`** (docs paths) or `workflow_dispatch`."},"2163":{"id":"/contribute/testing-docs-51","page_id":"/contribute/testing-docs","tags":["testing","coverage","fumadocs","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/testing-docs#deploy-docsyml","content":"Git branch"},"2164":{"id":"/contribute/testing-docs-52","page_id":"/contribute/testing-docs","tags":["testing","coverage","fumadocs","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/testing-docs#deploy-docsyml","content":"Pages alias"},"2165":{"id":"/contribute/testing-docs-53","page_id":"/contribute/testing-docs","tags":["testing","coverage","fumadocs","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/testing-docs#deploy-docsyml","content":"**`main`**"},"2166":{"id":"/contribute/testing-docs-54","page_id":"/contribute/testing-docs","tags":["testing","coverage","fumadocs","contributing"],"type":"text","url":"/contribute/testing-docs#deploy-docsyml","content":"**`latest`** (default site)"},"2167":{"id":"/contribute/te