`manage.sh stop` then `export-guides --film go-see --shot 12`. Workbench clay + depth + canny, not Cycles beauty. Path D: dump on the laptop, rsync `guides/`. Creator plates (not 5.00s): `blender-stills` then **klein-from-clay-plates** — Blender creator suite."},"3269":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-23","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#golden-path-script-door","content":"`manage.sh film-animatic --film go-see` — clay.mp4 or 5.00 s still holds, cap 90 s. Compose may stay up."},"3270":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-24","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#golden-path-script-door","content":"Start Comfy. Queue **dcc/clay-hero** on `first.png`, or stay on `:8188` with **dcc/guide-still** (Stay in Comfy after a Blender dump). Then `overlay-qc --film go-see --shot 12 --look PATH`. Iterate the look, not the print."},"3271":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-25","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#golden-path-script-door","content":"Stop Klein. `download-ltx --tier iclora` if needed. Queue **dcc/depth-control-12s** or Templates → LTX-2.5 Union Control (depth from `depth.mp4`). MagCache off. Distilled-only. Refuse 19B Union."},"3272":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-26","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#golden-path-script-door","content":"Stop LTX. Occupancy **audio**. `stem-mix --film go-see --shot 12 --bg PATH` (optional `--dx`). Duck −15 dB, YouTube loudnorm I=-14. App: **audio/stem-mix**."},"3273":{"id":"/learn/clay-to-finish-27","page_id":"/learn/clay-to-finish","tags":["learn","clay","dcc","ltx","audio","storyboard"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/clay-to-finish#golden-path-script-door","content":