der**"},"3657":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-10","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#backup-and-restore","content":"**`cleanup` vs a cache wipe**"},"3658":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-11","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#backup-and-restore","content":"**disk-wizard quarantine restore**"},"3659":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-12","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#backup-and-restore","content":"**What this enables**"},"3660":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-13","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#backup-and-restore","content":"**Recovering** a Spark without deleting Klein / Wan / LTX weights"},"3661":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-14","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#backup-and-restore","content":"**Knowing** that type **DELETE** is the Comfy volume only"},"3662":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-15","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#backup-and-restore","content":"**Moving** quarantined leftovers back after `disk-wizard --apply`"},"3663":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-16","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#backup-and-restore","content":"Stores: Architecture · Models and cache."},"3664":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-17","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#backup-and-restore","content":"`./scripts/manage.sh cleanup` (type **DELETE*&#x2A;) removes named volume &#x2A;*`ez-comfy-state`** only — Comfy install, venv, lab `ez_*` copies. It does **not** delete `${MODELS_DIR}` or `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}`. Do **not** run `docker system prune -a --volumes`. Do **not** `rm -rf` `${MODELS_DIR}` unless you intend to re-download tens of GB (throttled wrap). `reap-models` and `disk-wizard&#x60; default to &#x2A;*`--plan`**."},"3665":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-18","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Tree"},"3666":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-19","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Holds"},"3667":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-20","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Notes"},"3668":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-21","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"**`${MODELS_DIR}`** (default `/mnt/models`)"},"3669":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-22","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Klein / Wan / LTX / GGUF weights + `comfy/` relative symlinks"},"3670":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-23","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Largest. Shareable across Sparks. **Not** deleted by `cleanup`"},"3671":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-24","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"**`ez-comfy-state` volume**"},"3672":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-25","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Comfy install, venv, lab `ez_*` packs"},"3673":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-26","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"`cleanup` **DELETE** removes this. After a wipe, `start` reseeds from the GHCR prebuilt"},"3674":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-27","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"**`${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}`** (default `/mnt/comfy-output`)"},"3675":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-28","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"PNG/MP4/audio, `input/` LoadImage, `comfy-user/` graphs (including `_user/` and `_user/_rescued/`), `custom-nodes-user/`, `films/`, `guides/`, `assets/`, `research/`"},"3676":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-29","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Survives `stop` and `cleanup`"},"3677":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-30","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"**`${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/.occupancy.json`**"},"3678":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-31","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Occupancy desk state"},"3679":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-32","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Outputs tree, never `${MODELS_DIR}`"},"3680":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-33","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-to-back-up","content":"Three stores (image / weights / volume) are the mental model: the GHCR image is re-pullable; back up **weights** and **outputs**. The volume is optional — `start` can rebuild the install from the image."},"3681":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-34","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-not-to-back-up-as-secrets","content":"Item"},"3682":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-35","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-not-to-back-up-as-secrets","content":"Why"},"3683":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-36","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-not-to-back-up-as-secrets","content":"**`.env`**"},"3684":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-37","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-not-to-back-up-as-secrets","content":"May contain `HF_TOKEN`. Recreate from `.env.example` + `setup`"},"3685":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-38","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-not-to-back-up-as-secrets","content":"**`HF_TOKEN`**"},"3686":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-39","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-not-to-back-up-as-secrets","content":"Gated LTX (and any gated HF). Store in the operator's secret manager, not a media tarball"},"3687":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-40","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-not-to-back-up-as-secrets","content":"**Filled `spark-farm.example.env`**"},"3688":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-41","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-not-to-back-up-as-secrets","content":"Real hostnames stay off git. Placeholders only in-tree"},"3689":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-42","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#what-not-to-back-up-as-secrets","content":"Session vars in this browser (**Your Spark**) are localStorage, not a Spark backup."},"3690":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-43","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#restore-order","content":"**Host dirs** — writable `${MODELS_DIR}` and `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}` (`./scripts/manage.sh setup`)."},"3691":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-44","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#restore-order","content":"**Weights** — restore `${MODELS_DIR}` (or remount NFS). Then `./scripts/manage.sh doctor`. Missing files: `download-models` (throttled; `${DOWNLOAD_LIMIT}`)."},"3692":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-45","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#restore-order","content":"**Outputs** — restore `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}` (media, `comfy-user/`, occupancy JSON, films, guides)."},"3693":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-46","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#restore-order","content":"**Secrets** — put `HF_TOKEN` in `.env` or `hf auth login`. Do not unpack a token from a public backup."},"3694":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-47","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#restore-order","content":"**Compose** — `./scripts/manage.sh start` (type **yes**). Headroom preflight still runs. `restart: \"no\"` unchanged. If you did **not** restore `ez-comfy-state`, the entrypoint seeds from `/opt/comfy-prebuilt`."},"3695":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-48","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#restore-order","content":"**Occupancy** — optional: keep `.occupancy.json` or `occupancy enter idle` and start clean."},"3696":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-49","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#restore-order","content":"**Farm** — each Spark still types **yes** locally. Never remote `compose up`. Spark farm."},"3697":{"id":"/operate/backup-restore-50","page_id":"/operate/backup-restore","tags":["backup","restore","cleanup","disk-wizard","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/operate/backup-restore#disk-wizard-quarantine-restore","content":"`disk-wizard --apply --yes` **quarantines** review-class leftovers. Dest: `${MODELS_DIR}/.disk-quarantine/<utc>/` when the path is under `${MODELS_DIR}`, else `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/.disk-quarantine/<utc>/`.